#ASSERT `Under schedule 2 (section 159D(2) of the Social Security Administration Act 1992), what amount of universal credit is payable to me on the day` TRUE TRUE `s 1(1) what I know: no` 500 (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 31 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under schedule 2 (section 159D(2) of the Social Security Administration Act 1992), what amount of universal credit is payable to me on the day` TRUE TRUE `s 1(1) what I know: yes` 500 (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under schedule 2 (section 159D(2) of the Social Security Administration Act 1992), what amount of universal credit is payable to me on the day` FALSE TRUE `s 1(1) what I know: no` 500 (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
