-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part wra4 (merged by the lead on 2026-11-04; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- Cases for wra4-seat.l4.  Each seat question is asked with the same answers as the layer-1 assertions on the rule it calls
-- (one case for each distinct result, at most 4), so each case here is the layer-1 case seen through the seat.
-- A rule that returns a plain BOOLEAN is wrapped in JUST by the seat, so TRUE is JUST TRUE and FALSE is JUST FALSE;
-- NOTHING stays NOTHING (the text does not cover the case) and is never turned into FALSE.


§ `Sections 96 to 97: the benefit cap`

