#ASSERT `Under section 96(2), the most the cap can reduce my welfare benefits by` 2110.26 (JUST 2110.25) EQUALS JUST 0.01
#ASSERT `Under section 96(2), the most the cap can reduce my welfare benefits by` 2110.25 (JUST 2110.25) EQUALS NOTHING
