#ASSERT `Under section 96(2), my total entitlement to welfare benefits exceeds the relevant amount` 2110.25 2110.25 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 96(2), my total entitlement to welfare benefits exceeds the relevant amount` 2110.26 2110.25 EQUALS JUST TRUE
